    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hopkins Ward are delighted to present this attractive two-bedroom, two-bathroom first-floor apartment to the rental market, ideally located within the highly sought-after The Bottleworks development in Ringsend, Dublin 4.\n\nSet within a quiet and well-established residential development, this bright apartment offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation in an exceptionally convenient location. The property benefits from a sun-drenched private balcony and comes with one designated car parking space, making it an ideal home for professionals seeking a peaceful base close to Dublin city centre and the Docklands.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright living and dining area, a fitted kitchen, two good-sized bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite bathroom, together with a main bathroom. The private balcony provides an excellent outdoor space and is a particularly appealing feature of the apartment.\n\nThe location is one of the property`s greatest assets. Ringsend offers the best of both worlds a peaceful residential setting while being within easy reach of Grand Canal Dock, Ballsbridge, Sandymount and Dublin city centre. The nearby Docklands is home to many of Dublin`s major technology, financial and professional employers, including Google and a wide range of international companies.\n\nFor sporting and entertainment enthusiasts, the Aviva Stadium, RDS and Bord Gáis Energy Theatre are all close by, while Ringsend Park, Sandymount Strand and the surrounding coastal area provide excellent options for walking, running and outdoor recreation.\n\nThere is an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and everyday amenities in Ringsend, Grand Canal Dock, Sandymount and Ballsbridge. Grand Canal Dock DART station is also nearby, providing convenient access towards the city centre and along the Dublin coastline, while numerous bus routes serve the surrounding area.\n\nThe property is also particularly well positioned for those working in the Dublin 4 and Dublin Docklands business districts, with major employers and offices within easy walking or cycling distance.\n\nAvailable for immediate rental.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n- Two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment\n- First-floor position\n- Quiet residential development\n- Sun-drenched private balcony\n- One designated car parking space\n- Excellent Dublin 4 location\n- Close to Grand Canal Dock and the Docklands\n- Convenient for the Aviva Stadium and RDS\n- Easy access to Sandymount, Ballsbridge and the city centre\n- Excellent public transport connections\n- Close to many of Dublin`s major technology and professional employers\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
